{"series":{"id":"bking","slug":"bking","title":"B.King","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/bking-1__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"(Spirit Master / B.King)Tras alcanzar la fama con su cómic 驭灵师 (Spirit Master), un autor en decadencia comienza a sacrificar a sus personajes para recuperar audiencia. De forma inesperada, es absorbido por su propia obra y reencarna en el cuerpo de Wang Xiaoming. Ahora, con la mentalidad del creador y conociendo cada secreto de la trama, deberá navegar el peligroso mundo que él mismo diseñó, utilizando sus conocimientos privilegiados para tomar un atajo divino y alcanzar el poder absoluto. Estudio: UKA (Una bruja sin cerebro) Estreno: 26_02_2026","genres":["Isekai","Comedia","Fantasía","Acción"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/bking","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:39:33.921Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"bking-1","slug":"bking-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"bking","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:39:43.156Z","episodeCount":18,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":18,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"bking-1-1","slug":"bking-1-1","title":"B.King — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:39:34.301Z","seriesId":"bking","seasonId":"bking-1","number":1,"releaseDate":null},{"id":"bking-1-2","slug":"bking-1-2","title":"B.King — Cap. 2","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-2","servers":[],"previousUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-1","nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-3","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:39:34.836Z","seriesId":"bking","seasonId":"bking-1","number":2,"releaseDate":null},{"id":"bking-1-3","slug":"bking-1-3","title":"B.King — Cap. 3","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/bking-1-3","ser